  "part": {
    "name": "Mounting bracket with curved arm and top threaded boss",
    "description": "Single-piece bracket comprising: a rectangular base foot with two vertical mounting through-holes; an upright/arm body with a large internal C-shaped clearance cavity and diagonal gusset; a top cylindrical boss with a vertical (threaded) bore and chamfer; a small transverse pin hole in the upper body; and opposed rounded-rectangle side recess pockets on the arm/body sides (lightening/clearance).",
    "source_views": [
      "front",
      "back",
      "left",
      "right",
      "top",
      "bottom",
      "toprightiso"
    ],
    "symmetry_note": "Geometry is largely symmetric about the mid-thickness plane in Z for several features (base corner rounds, mounting holes, many cavity surfaces), but the part also shows stepped thickness regions (e.g., base vs. upper body) and sided recess details that reduce perfect global symmetry."
  },
